i": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_643955654606405_480568527955268312_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jvhRA5wHjZoQ7kNvwF3gHyo&_nc_oc=AdoV9aN9AP7oBNGCzu-jhRbEDvQ5I7NW1h_iuTTslmWPiTwg9GKMhglC-2YfM7RNbqk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6C2tJnsV1EmpLqvqDmgSU9PZVLXp5hYNpN33k7s8CBVg&oe=6A11C2E6"}, {"file_name": "Master.00_00_34_53.Still005.png", "id": "868776144968854", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57574721_868776148302187_2395318248093284663_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XVMSceJongEQ7kNvwGe6k0_&_nc_oc=Adqm_OR51p5iebJUGA4VPRid-uDcnaK3697gv_XHj0eAUIS7wUNs9N5dvJxKrsvGBpI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4mIWiFonWXDxSpo97flgSDXkHQ0XlrUAvHD1S596J57Q&oe=6A11B832"}, {"file_name": "Master.00_00_25_53.Still002.png", "id": "692760662818107", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982461_692760666151440_1673600769700015261_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zUh0SbZVYTwQ7kNvwGSjxVp&_nc_oc=Adp4P_T9cQFIUnjFV90BsQZXuB3gAmFssJADmQiK_2_qbrvm07Q0Fb76HRM0xORlzYk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5TiDTuK-MkfExw01L5RJCHMDu5hZVIhcocwF2C8S6SgA&oe=6A11B1FB"}, {"file_name": "2023-07-01 19-38-56.mp4.00_05_33_04.Still001.png", "id": "1014728119759484", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974571_1014728126426150_3738956639406327634_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kZzsu_04UpAQ7kNvwFewHP_&_nc_oc=AdrNOn9NwEgck8rm76iVl7DMtLQHXYdb-L-YHUCHzdtTAiI-6TITEuuIFTPY3w-rwY8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af749D8GMa67Ug4l96cTykD2sZ9L-FpB9JRTe7l8-c1LCQ&oe=6A11C773"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_End_Card-Recovered.png", "id": "273391962004750", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974788_273391965338083_1886064065722113930_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sJVzxP2iZksQ7kNvwG46yrr&_nc_oc=AdoWRSeY2oDFiE6qkkEupcJzhgOYdgbS_47XqQ7DYv3-UKC9agf6EMqGf8cY9MQsCxI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af72cXYOlNEW9uCoevgDR-ltirZb0euqOlsv4CXshbOJMg&oe=6A11C572"}, "display_name": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures", "keywords": ["Cockpit", "Alien", "Green", "Space", "Physics"], "long_description": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures is a VR cockpit game combining ship management with action-arcade combat. You play as a (sometimes effective) bounty hunter with possibly questionable morals, currently in possession of a powerful little alien that you may or may not have stolen/liberated from the evil Empire. As the Empire closes in, you'll need to find a way to balance your ship's management with the onslaught of attacks. Do you have what it takes to survive?\n\n\u2022 Become one with the ship: Immerse yourself in a cockpit packed full from ceiling to floor with distinct physics-based interactions (Though make sure to keep your eye on them all if you want to survive!).\n\n\u2022 Rebel against The Empire: Engage in thrilling dogfights as squads of enemies pursue you to re-capture the small green treasure aboard your ship - shoot bullets, launch bombs, and raise your shields. It's going to get bumpy!\n\n\u2022 Navigate the vacuum of space: Control the ship with a radical and easy-to-use virtual flight stick design, dodge your way through hazardous space environments, and don't forget to do a barrel roll!\n\n\u2022 The little guy: Who could forget your cosmic friend, Ziggy?! This mysterious creature is a perfect fuel source. You can also play with them, use them as a resource, feed them, and most importantly pet them!\n\n\u2022 The Journey: Fight your way through 13 unique levels total. Forge a different path each time by beating challenges and unlocking harder worlds en route.", "short_description": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures is a VR cockpit game combining ship management with action-arcade combat. You play as a (sometimes effective) bounty hunter with possibly questionable morals, currently in possession of a powerful little alien that you may or may not have stolen/liberated from the evil Empire. As the Empire closes in, you'll need to find a way to balance your ship's management with the onslaught of attacks. Do you have what it takes to survive?"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Ziggy_Monoscopic.png", "id": "1296582511245835", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974446_1296582517912501_8438674573824683709_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=E-JENoYhcPoQ7kNvwH2-Z2k&_nc_oc=AdoA-0DBS5H06C6qc8xo2tP_NR4jU90k69u9ov4L6bnjmHOzlV__qIQafvic0CBUsWI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7seJaQIThm5FPp8Mz6xNX132CmTIeg1YvWpvc9okZJog&oe=6A11BCD3"}, {"file_name": "CoverSquare.png", "id": "1124369782419830", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036658_1124369785753163_6062844584904789074_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EKd1ruGzH6IQ7kNvwF42CBH&_nc_oc=AdrM4VnHC1Rn0DUab89La-I2yVEQCwotc3CkzPTC6I_rdRHiXHKlhJi2dpTyXPxgh78&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4bK1OSByJnchLyNy8GECOE9SJMM40FtwFUxFvBAAlA0A&oe=6A11B8EF"}, {"file_name": "Icon_v1.png", "id": "1106448921139578", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001696_1106448927806244_1890053882317213161_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SH4KcdVL2hoQ7kNvwHCjiIn&_nc_oc=AdrEn4qW5mCEjPY8ZLzBEa6mg5sIFXjKLJJfY_nPPehvQZSGYzCiYEcNLoEy_R9vVpg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6erZIwuYO44LqM_ll_ouA7OyCW1zhrI1fOVToN9jtfwg&oe=6A11C4A2"}, {"file_name": "Logo.png", "id": "973425620588096", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86610716_973425627254762_